  "summary": "A set of constants for the styles available for scrollbars used with [Titanium.UI.ScrollView.scrollIndicatorStyle](api:Titanium.UI.ScrollView#scrollIndicatorStyle) and [Titanium.UI.TableView.scrollIndicatorStyle](api:Titanium.UI.TableView#scrollIndicatorStyle) properties.",
